    60	Stub height 2% of 340px = 6.8px — sub-legible as a *bar* by design; its LABEL carries readability (fit leg prices the label, not the stub). Full-fill timing grouped with stub3 risks muddying order (mitigation: stub3 lands 400ms before fill starts). Persian labels in specimen are specimen text — recreation uses parameterized Latin labels (production consumer is English DLC); priced as content parameterization, not a defect. Exit fade is an allocation (census shows a cut to next scene, not a fade) — named departure: build fades because the comparison loops; the fade sits after holdEnd.
