130:- **L10 — The constant-vs-curve pair.** Class: technique. Consumer: DLC assembler — diagram container. Change: any "your odds are fixed" beat is drawn as a dashed constant line against a rising solid curve from the same origin — the two-line refutation of static probability. Build cost: cheap — two path animations on one axis set. (Stands on T10 / ev/120-probability-curve-rise.jpg, this packet's G-d.)
